<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>推荐结果</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>你的八字分析结果</h1>

  <p><strong>日主（日干）:</strong> <%= dayGan %>（<%= userElement %>）</p>
  <p><strong>月令（月支）:</strong> <%= monthBranch %>（<%= monthElement %>）</p>
  <p><strong>你的身强/身弱情况:</strong> <%= bodyStatus %></p>
  <p><strong>你需要补充的五行是:</strong> <%= neededElement %></p>
  <p><strong>今天的天干:</strong> <%= todayStem %>（<%= todayElement %>）</p>
  <p><strong>今天是:</strong> <%= todayStatus %></p>

  <h2>为你推荐的今日饮品是：<%= recommendedDrink %> 🍹</h2>

  <br><br>
  <a href="/">返回重新输入</a>
</body>
</html>
